      "Art and video containers set pointer-events:none. Header, title and content re-enable pointer events, while the portrait drawer gets its own z-index and clipped boundary. This makes the controls usable even where the artwork physically overlaps them. The text itself stays legible with stacked white glow shadows instead of a large opaque panel. On initial load, a fixed #141414 overlay with z-index:100 covers the whole composition.",
